{"applicability_conditions":"适用于观察到 SRO 效应的高 Al 含量（> 6 wt%）Fe–Mn–C–Al 钢。","identity":{"block_id":"b0062","equation_id":"equation_007","equation_number":"7","is_image":false,"latex_hint":"$$\nW _ {\\mathrm{R}} = \\frac {\\gamma}{\\mu} - 2 (1 + \\nu) b _ {\\mathrm{e}} \\Omega c / \\pi (1 - \\nu)\\tag{7}\n$$","paper_id":"10.1002_srin.202200191"},"latex":"W_{\\mathrm{R}} = \\frac{\\gamma}{\\mu} - 2 (1 + \\nu) b_{\\mathrm{e}} \\Omega c / \\pi (1 - \\nu)","purpose":"计算位错滑移模式参数 W_R 随 Al 原子溶质含量 c 等参数的变化，用于描述高铝 Fe–Mn–C–Al 钢中短程有序（SRO）效应对位错滑移模式的影响。","symbols":[{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"位错滑移模式（dislocation slip mode）参数","symbol":"W_{\\mathrm{R}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"基体材料的层错能（SFE, stacking fault energy）","symbol":"\\gamma","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":null,"symbol":"\\mu","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"泊松比（Poisson ratio）","symbol":"\\nu","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"Burgers 矢量的刃型分量（edge component of Burger's vector）","symbol":"b_{\\mathrm{e}}","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"原子尺寸失配（atomic size misfit）","symbol":"\\Omega","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":false,"meaning":"Al 原子溶质含量（Al atomic solute content）","symbol":"c","unit":null,"value":null},{"is_constant":true,"meaning":"圆周率（数学常数）","symbol":"\\pi","unit":null,"value":null}],"unmapped":["μ（出现在 γ/μ 分母中）在提供的上下文中未给出定义。","W_R 的下标 R 在提供的上下文中未给出解释。","该公式来自先前研究（文献 [77]）。"]}